Blitz
Origin: https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz
Release: v0.3.0-beta.4
Commit: 92b11f1bd8ab7975411328b0406a95a09445b4e7
Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (we use Apache-2.0).
Use: pinned dependencies blitz-dom, blitz-html, blitz-paint, blitz-traits and
stylo_taffy. crates/isr-core/src/lib.rs adapts offscreen scene construction from
examples/screenshot.rs. crates/isr/src/main.rs retains PNG encoding as CLI I/O.
DOM traversal and rectangle inspection follow
packages/blitz-test-harness/src/inspect.rs. Our adaptations replace URL fetching
with a data-only provider, add document-order JSON and retain upstream layout,
text, style and paint implementations. crates/isr-core/src/geometry.rs builds
row/group rectangles from the upstream cell geometry, uses upstream
BaseDocument::node_client_rects to union inline fragments, and interprets SVG
shape geometry via the already-depended-on kurbo path parser. It paints collapsed
horizontal row borders from the resolved cell border properties. This file is
original integration code, not a vendored upstream patch.
Unmodified upstream licences: third-party/Blitz-LICENSE-APACHE and
third-party/Blitz-LICENSE-MIT. Upstream has no root NOTICE at this commit.

