and integrity hashes are pinned in package-lock.json. Dependencies remain
separate upstream packages, not relicensed source files in this repository.
The main pipeline dependencies are:
- Stylo 0.22.0, https://github.com/servo/stylo, MPL-2.0.
  Kept exclusively as a dependency; no MPL source is copied or adapted.
