- Parley 0.12.0, https://github.com/linebender/parley, Apache-2.0 OR MIT.
- html5ever 0.40.1, https://github.com/servo/html5ever, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- AnyRender 0.14.0 and anyrender_vello_cpu 0.18.0,
  https://github.com/DioxusLabs/anyrender, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- Vello CPU 0.3.0, https://github.com/linebender/vello, Apache-2.0 OR MIT.
- Peniko 0.6.1, https://github.com/linebender/peniko, Apache-2.0 OR MIT.
- data-url 0.3.2, https://github.com/servo/rust-url, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- png 0.18.1, https://github.com/image-rs/image-png, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- Serde 1.0.229 and serde_json 1.0.154, https://github.com/serde-rs,
