Chromium is downloaded by Playwright as an external reference tool. It is not
embedded in or redistributed by our native renderer. Its bundled notices remain
in the external browser installation.

third-party/rust-dependencies.json records every resolved Rust package's origin,
exact version, licence expression and upstream commit where included in the
published crate. Git dependencies use their pinned source URL. The lockfile
checksums identify registry packages even when upstream omitted VCS metadata.
Regenerate with python tools/dependency-notices.py after dependency updates.

All fixture markup, CSS, SVG paths, comparison tools and gate code are original work for
html-native-renderer under Apache-2.0, apart from the embedded font noted above.
